OL,3,GNEWSAThe 260-year-old pub that has
OL,4,Abecome a 'disgrace'
OL,5,
OL,6,FResidents living near a derelict pub
OL,7,Fwhich has become a hotspot for
OL,8,Fantisocial behaviour have welcomed news
OL,9,Fof the site being put up for sale.
OL,11,FThe Old Red Lion on York Road in
OL,12,FWhinmoor had been a pub since the 1760s
OL,13,Fbut has fallen into disrepair since
OL,14,Fclosing in 2021, with arsonists
OL,15,Ftargeting the venue nine times in 16
OL,16,Fdays this summer, according to West
OL,17,FYorkshire Fire and Rescue Service.
OL,23,APub: 10-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,390,380,200,160,0,100
